# release-gate allowlist examples
#
# This file is documentation only. The scanner does not read it.
# Supported suppressions are intentionally narrow:
#
# 1. Exclude whole files in tools/release-gate.toml [scope].exclude_globs.
# 2. Suppress one false-positive line with an inline marker and a reason.
#
# Examples:
#
#   docs/windows-example.md: path = "C:\\Users\\Alice\\demo"  # release-gate: allow generic docs example
#   docs/token-shapes.md: token = "sk-or-v1-example000"  # release-gate: allow fake token shape
#
# Prefer line-level markers over broad excludes. Never allowlist real secrets,
# raw tracker data, private prompts, backups, env files, or forced-added ignored
# files.
